Faisal: Rules are rules. No ticket, no entry. Calm down!

3
00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:12.601
Narrator: Watch the fan's face.

4
00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:14.902
Narrator: Is this getting better or worse?

5
00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:16.502
Narrator: What would you do?
